WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.597
The final part places the L L M inside a real application boundary.

00:00:04.597 --> 00:00:11.567
The model can read untrusted text, request tools, and influence application behavior,

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:14.969
so software controls around the model become essential.

00:00:15.662 --> 00:00:20.534
We will finish by distinguishing ordinary tool calling from an agentic loop,

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:23.553
which prepares the transition to Agentic rag.
